NOTE ON CONTENT:

The MIT license above applies to the Foundry VTT system code (module/, css/,
templates/, system.json, lang/, src/packs/ schemas, etc.).

The bundled rules content under packs/ and src/packs/ — backgrounds, traits,
monsters, spellbooks, weapons, armor, gear, consumables, ammunition, loot,
and the rules-reference journal — is derived from the MCDM Crows TTRPG public
playtest packet (May-June 2026), © MCDM Productions. The playtest packet
itself is published by MCDM at:

  https://www.patreon.com/posts/crows-may-2026-158948625

This Foundry system implements the rules so groups can play the playtest at
the virtual table. The art and battlemaps under playtest-packet/ are
likewise © MCDM Productions, included here strictly for at-table use during
the playtest. If MCDM Productions requests changes or removal, that will be
honored.
